---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";

const title = "Now";
const description = "What I'm up to right now in life!";

import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import leela from "../images/now/leela.webp";
---

<style>
  h1 {
    color: white;
  }

  h2 {
    margin-bottom: 0;
    color: white;
  }

  .last-update {
    font-size: 16px;
    margin-top: 0;
    color: white;
    font-weight: normal;
  }

  /* Wavy white frame: a 30x30 SVG sliced into a 9-part border-image, with one
     wave period per edge tile and quarter arcs at the corners. */
  img {
    max-width: 240px;
    height: auto;
    align-self: flex-start;
    padding: 2px;
    border: 10px solid transparent;
    border-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' width='30' height='30' viewBox='0 0 30 30'><path fill='none' stroke='white' stroke-width='1.5' d='M10,3 C12.5,3 12.5,7 15,7 S17.5,3 20,3 A7,7 0 0 1 27,10 C27,12.5 23,12.5 23,15 S27,17.5 27,20 A7,7 0 0 1 20,27 C17.5,27 17.5,23 15,23 S12.5,27 10,27 A7,7 0 0 1 3,20 C3,17.5 7,17.5 7,15 S3,12.5 3,10 A7,7 0 0 1 10,3 Z'/></svg>")
      10 round;
  }
</style>

<SiteLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <h1>now</h1>
  <p class="last-update">Last updated 23rd September 2026</p>

  <h2>Life</h2>
  <p>
    I've been pretty focused on home decluttering recently, getting ready for my
    partner to move in. Gotta make space for two people and a cat now!
  </p>

  <p>For the cat tax, a picture of Leela herself.</p>

  <Image
    src={leela}
    alt="Leela, a fluffy black cat with yellow eyes and a small patch of white fur on her chest, sits upright on a light-colored floor looking forward."
  />

  <p>
    I've also been focussing a lot more on healthier eating and exercise
    recently, and I sure do miss putting cheese on everything 😭
  </p>

  <h2>Work</h2>

  <p>
    I've been working a lot on SEO optimisation recently. On the side I've been
    experimenting a lot with{" "}
    <a href="https://typesafe.ai/blog/introducing-system-one-models-and-jev">
      Jev
    </a>{" "}
    and getting some really exciting results out of the classifier.
  </p>

  <hr />

  <p>
    Page inspired by <a href="https://nownownow.com/about">nownownow.com</a>
  </p>
</SiteLayout>
